1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:04,556
Weekend. Four people. One table of gems.

2
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,480
Splendor — the family edition.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:14,872
The rules are simple: take gems, buy cards, reach fifteen points, then finish the round.

4
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:21,292
On your turn, do one thing: take gems, buy a card, or reserve one.

5
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:25,540
Every card you buy is a permanent discount — and points.

6
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:34,824
Match a noble's bonuses and they visit you for three more points.

7
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,488
Four players on one screen — or everyone joins from a phone.

8
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:45,224
On your own network, scan and sit down. Nothing to install.

9
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:50,544
Four AI levels, a slower pace, and an undo for the odd mistake.

10
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,364
One more game tonight.
